[{"id":"CN-TR-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","三次握手"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 三次握手分别确认什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>客户端 SYN 提供客户端 ISN；服务端 SYN-ACK 确认客户端 ISN 并提供服务端 ISN；客户端 ACK 确认服务端 ISN，双方进入已建立状态。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三次的关键是双向初始序列空间和回程可达性。握手成功不代表应用已经完成 TLS、HTTP 或业务认证。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>握手报文至少要和状态一起读：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>报文\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>关键确认\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>典型状态\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SYN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>客户端提出 ISN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>SYN-SENT\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SYN-ACK\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端确认并提出 ISN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>SYN-RECEIVED\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ACK\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>客户端确认服务端 ISN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>ESTABLISHED\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>握手超时、RST 和握手成功后的 TLS/HTTP 失败是不同证据，不能用一个“端口不通”概括。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-skip-vs-xfail","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["结果标记"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制","articlePath":"posts/b5dda780/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(三)测试收集与运行控制","articlePath":"posts/b5dda780/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>何时使用 skip，何时使用 xfail？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>无法或不应在当前环境执行时用 skip；已知会失败但仍需要执行并追踪缺陷时用 xfail，并关注 XPASS。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>skip\u003c/code> 的含义是“当前条件下不执行”，因此它不能证明该行为在本环境成立；\u003ccode>xfail\u003c/code> 仍会执行测试，并把预期失败记录为结果。需要把预期写成可审查的代码：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.mark.skipif(\u003cspan class=\"params\">sys.platform == \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;win32&quot;\u003c/span>, reason=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;依赖 Unix socket&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_unix_socket\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    ...\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.mark.xfail(\u003cspan class=\"params\">reason=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;upstream issue #123&quot;\u003c/span>, strict=\u003cspan class=\"literal\">True\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">test_known_regression\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    ...\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>strict=True\u003c/code> 会把修复后的 XPASS 变成可见失败，提醒团队删除或更新标记；否则一个已经不再失败的测试可能长期被当成“预期状态”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-booking-change","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","预约","改期"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程","articlePath":"posts/7677ef32/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(九)状态迁移与业务流程","articlePath":"posts/7677ef32/"}],"articleIndex":6,"articleCount":9,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>预约取消与改期如何测试状态和竞争？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>覆盖已确认预约成功改期、目标无空位、取消后改期非法和重复提交，并验证原/新时段只有一个有效结果。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>教学规则包含待确认、已确认、已取消、已完成状态，改期必须有新时段且失败保留原预约。成功改期要检查新时段占用和旧时段释放；无空位不得破坏原预约；取消后改期应拒绝且无新记录；重复提交用幂等键只产生一次改期。追问改期与取消竞争时，按服务端版本或事务顺序确定终态。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-umbrella-transfer","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","雨伞","状态"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何设计雨伞的功能测试用例？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>按关闭、打开、锁定、遮雨和收拢状态建模，在安全的喷水模拟条件下覆盖边界和非法操作。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先声明手动雨伞、规定尺寸和模拟雨量，不做真实危险天气试验。代表轨迹是打开并锁定、未锁定尝试携带、规定角度喷水、收拢后再次打开；预期写状态、锁扣、遮挡范围和水是否进入。折叠伞或自动伞会增加弹簧、按钮和夹伤风险，需重新澄清状态与安全边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]